        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-27T02:01:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought the melee immunity was because they are in the air, kind of like flying pokemon being resistant to fighting attacks. Mechanics trumps theme in most cases, but Expat's bullets don't care that Mable's not on the ground in reach of fists. I have no doubt Fixer's fist is as powerful as a bullet. He could probably catch one if the situation called for it.</p>",
